    "additionalInformation": "<ul><li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">In preparation for your hike, please find information including safety resources on our website <a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.cape2camp.com\"><b style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 136, 204); font-size: 14px;\">www.cape2camp.com</b></a><b style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</b></li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">10 days prior to your hike, Cape2Camp will create a <b style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">WhatsApp</b> group for all participating hikers.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">Essentials&nbsp;for your daypack may include power bank, 2 litres of water (day 1), blister aid, xtra thongs/ sandals, swimwear, sun screen, tissue paper, mosquito repellent and fly net. Hand luggage: torch, toiletries and xtra clothes.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">You will be transported by mini bus from Waterwheel to&nbsp;Margaret River Mouth Day1.&nbsp;Cape2Camp meet you at this location where&nbsp;you can drop off your extra hand luggage tagged with your name, please. And you get your lunch from us here.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">If you have not already completed and returned your <b style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(25, 35, 45); font-size: 14px;\">hiking waiver (attached)&nbsp;</b>you can sign with us on day 1.&nbsp;</li></ul>",
